 "status": "Declared and frozen before any 8-K submissions row was read. At declaration, 31 of the 100 discovery.json files are in the clone; the preflight parsed only their sources lists, and no row was inspected or counted. The other 69 discovery files, all 100 root and 79 history raw sources, the retained calendar and the terminal qualification events are absent. No prices, returns, S/Q values or exhibits were read.",
 "question": "For the fixed 100-issuer original 10-Q corpus of the completed cash-backed earnings comparison, how often does a same-CIK original 8-K whose items include Item 2.02 become public at least one XNYS session before the 10-Q's frozen decision session?",
