  "row_reconstruction": "Re-parse every discovery source in saved order with the frozen capture table_rows parser: source 0 is the root filings.recent table, later sources are bare history arrays. Keep every occurrence with (source index, row index). The concatenation must equal discovery.json rows exactly, else the issuer is unavailable.",
  "source_location": "Reused sources resolve repository-relative and must equal the frozen request reuse catalog entry; captured sources resolve under source_root. Per-issuer inputs (each discovery.json and reused root source) are bound under issuer_inputs: an absent one makes only that issuer unavailable, while present bytes that differ from a bound or recorded SHA256/byte length stop the whole attempt. Global inputs, code and manifests must all be present and unchanged. The full input state must be identical at the start and end of the attempt.",
