  "window_rule": "Same-issuer rows with 10-Q reportDate < filingDate <= reportDate + 83 calendar days. The shortest 12-week next quarter ends at reportDate + 84 days, and its results cannot be filed before it ends, so the next period's results release cannot enter the window. 10-Qs filed after the window end are flagged late_10q_beyond_window, not re-windowed.",
  "amendments": "In-window 8-K/A rows with Item 2.02 are reported and never candidates."
 },
