  "rule": "Both the 10-Q and every candidate use the frozen filing-features event_clock unchanged: availability floor 01:00 ET on the calendar day after max(ET acceptance date, filingDate); decision session is the first XNYS session whose 09:00 ET is at or after the floor.",
  "timing": "prior if the candidate decision session is strictly earlier than the 10-Q decision session; same_session if equal; after if later. lead_sessions counts XNYS sessions; lead_hours is API acceptance difference.",
